# Kurgast (M6, D-095): a cheerful elderly spa guest of Bad Ischl, taking
# the cure. White bathrobe w/i with an m belt, a blue S/b towel round his
# neck, a straw hat Y/o, grey hair and moustache i, pale shins c, R slippers.
# Prop: a cup of brine (Sole) s/S held out in front. Faces right;
# mirror = auto.
# walk: a slow slipper shuffle (feet apart / together).
# liegen, wake: the `liegestuhl` art cropped to its 16 px platform, chair at
# the bottom (rows 8-23, flat top at row 8), for an engine that draws the
# lying Kurgast with this sprite; wake = yawning, both arms stretched up
# from behind the hood. squished (fallback only, D-095): dozed off flat on
# the ground, his hat over his face.
# Built with a scratch script (layers + automatic k outline), frozen here.
sprite = kurgast
size   = 16x24
origin = 8,24
hitbox = 2,2,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = walk     frames=2 ticks=12 loop
anim   = liegen   frames=1
anim   = wake     frames=2 ticks=10 loop
anim   = squished frames=1
